 r←Test_Server_418(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;html
⍝ Ask for the deprecated packages; pretends to be a Browser
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 r←T._Failed

 html←∆GetHtmlFromServer'[localhost]/v1/deprecated-pkgs'
 →T.PassesIf∨/'<h2>Deprecated packages <span class="page-sub">'⍷html
 →T.PassesIf∨/'href="/v1/packages/versions/example-deprecated-1"'⍷html

 r←T._OK
⍝Done
